## Project knowledge

{% if is_codex is defined and is_codex -%}
When the DRI asks you to remember or correct a project fact the code does not show, read `.agents/skills/project-knowledge/SKILL.md` and follow it: facts go to `.claude/memory/wiki.md`, not auto-memory.
{%- elif (config.locale | default('en')) == 'ko' -%}
DRI 가 코드에 없는 프로젝트 사실을 기억하라고 하거나 기록된 사실을 정정하면 `project-knowledge` skill 을 따른다. 사실은 host auto-memory 가 아니라 `.claude/memory/wiki.md` 에 기록한다 (auto-memory 는 개인 선호만).
{%- else -%}
When the DRI asks you to remember a project fact the code does not show, or corrects a recorded one, follow the `project-knowledge` skill: facts go to `.claude/memory/wiki.md`, not host auto-memory, which keeps personal preferences only.
{%- endif %}
